  "economy.diagram.currencyLine": "mo motshamekong",
  "economy.diagram.desc": "Tsela ya go bona: tshameka dikgaisano, o bone madi a mo motshamekong. Tsela ya go reka: madi a nnete a reka madi a mo motshamekong. Ditsela tsotlhe tse pedi di lebisa kwa lefelong le le tshwanang: dikepe, ditokafatso tsa dikepe le dikgabisa, mme morago o boele mo dikgaisanong. E rulagantswe, ga e a agiwa.",
